OL,3,GNEWSALightning strike sparks fire and
OL,4,Adamages homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lightning strike to a telegraph pole
OL,7,Fhas caused a fire at a home and left a
OL,8,Fnumber of other properties damaged.
OL,10,FFirefighters, police and ambulance
OL,11,Fcrews were called to Shepherds Croft in
OL,12,FPortland, Dorset, shortly after 21:35
OL,13,FGMT on Tuesday night.
OL,15,FA camera at a holiday cottage at
OL,16,FPortland Bill captured the lightning
OL,17,Fstrike, which the owners said "we
OL,18,Fhonestly thought was an explosion...
OL,19,Fnot thunder".
