OL,3,GNEWSALightning strike sparks fire and
OL,4,Adamages homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire service said the bolt of
OL,7,Flightning caused structural damage to
OL,8,Fsome homes and damage to sockets,
OL,9,Frouters and cabling within others. No
OL,10,Finjuries had been reported.
